 "changesFromC1011": [
  "Four single-compound variants whose compounds already have accepted label facts and accepted artwork at another strength. CLAUDE-1 proposed their facts in KAN-59/11984, copying the product name, classification and do-not-print terms unchanged from the same compound's accepted record and taking the amount from the pinned variant label; CLAUDE-2 adopted these four in KAN-59/12084 after checking each row against its selected source. Three other proposed rows (GEN-GRP-0335, 0359 and 0361) were not adopted and are not in this batch.",
  "build_c1.py, xr_compose.py, svg_label_render.py, wpf_kern.ps1 and verify_c1.py are byte-identical to C1-011's copies. c1_variants.py adds only the reference of the adopted facts. write_manifest.py records this batch's claim reference and this note. The kern table covers the strings in this batch."
 ],
